Description: Tools for simulation, estimation, diagnostics, and exploratory
    analysis of multidimensional spatial and spatio-temporal point processes.
    The package supports Poisson and marked Poisson point processes,
    scalar and functional covariates, covariate-based intensity models,
    multidimensional inhomogeneous K-function estimators, residual and
    global-envelope diagnostics, log-Gaussian Cox processes, and
    epidemic-type aftershock sequence models with parametric Poisson
    background intensities.
